{"name":"Disruption with some GitHub services","status":"resolved","created_at":"2026-07-16T09:13:51.604Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:50:38.354Z","monitoring_at":"2026-07-16T09:30:47.310Z","resolved_at":"2026-07-16T12:20:56.418Z","impact":"critical","shortlink":"https://stspg.io/5c43kg01skdw","scheduled_for":null,"scheduled_until":null,"scheduled_remind_prior":false,"scheduled_reminded_at":null,"impact_override":"critical","scheduled_auto_in_progress":false,"scheduled_auto_completed":false,"metadata":{},"started_at":"2026-07-16T09:13:51.585Z","reminder_intervals":null,"id":"d35pngcy6sb9","page_id":"kctbh9vrtdwd","incident_updates":[{"status":"resolved","body":"On July 16, 2026, between 08:50 UTC and 09:50 UTC, the GitHub MCP Server’s web_search tool experienced elevated failures. The average error rate was 42% and peaked at 82% of requests to the tool. Other GitHub MCP Server tools were unaffected. This was caused by degradation at a downstream web search provider.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe incident was mitigated when the downstream provider recovered, after which we confirmed that the tool’s success rate had returned to normal.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe are improving the tool’s resilience and failure handling to reduce the customer impact and duration of similar incidents.","created_at":"2026-07-16T12:20:56.418Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:50:38.348Z","display_at":"2026-07-16T12:20:56.418Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"fmg02pz6lb8p","incident_id":"d35pngcy6sb9","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":null},{"status":"monitoring","body":"The degradation has been mitigated. We are monitoring to ensure stability.","created_at":"2026-07-16T10:17:11.365Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-07-16T10:17:11.365Z","display_at":"2026-07-16T10:17:11.365Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"n04x38chj5p3","incident_id":"d35pngc